<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.10">
<l>paruvaraṅka ḷavaipaṟṟip paṭaiyālit teḻuntāṉai</l>
<l>ceruvaraṅkap porutaḻitta tiruvāḷaṉ tiruppatimēl</l>
<l>tiruvaraṅkat tamiḻmālai viṭṭucittaṉ virittaṉakoṇ</l>
<l>ṭiruvaraṅka merittāṉai yēttavallā raṭiyōmē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>We are servants to those who are able to praise him,</l>
<l rend="indent">who burned the two bodies,</l>
<l>with [this] Tamil garland [about] holy Araṅkam</l> 
<l rend="indent">compsed by Viṭṭucittaṉ</l>
<l>on the divine ruler of Tiruppati</l>
<l rend="indent">who fought the one who, have obtained great boons,</l>
<l>arose, roaring in battle,[and] oblitereated [him]</l>
<l rend="indent">so that he was destroyed in battle.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
